OL,3,GNEWSARobbers ram-raid city centre
OL,4,Aclothing store
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a
OL,7,Fhigh-end clothing store was ram-raided
OL,8,Fby robbers in Leeds city centre.
OL,10,FA red Kia Creed was deliberately driven
OL,11,Finto the Belstaff store, in the
OL,12,FVictoria Quarter, in Vicar Lane at
OL,13,Fabout 20:40 GMT on Monday, while a
OL,14,Fsecond car - also a Kia Creed - waited
OL,15,Fnearby.
OL,17,FWest Yorkshire Police said a number of
OL,18,Fpeople went into the shop and stole a
OL,19,Flarge quantity of clothing.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
